<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIXING.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIXING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor market interest</p>
<p>rates edged lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Thursday. The three-month rate was at 3.35 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 5 fix	    Sept 4 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.30 pct		3.31 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.35 pct		3.36 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.50 pct		3.53 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.64 pct		3.65 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.76 pct		3.79 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
